## Dusk

::bg{location="skerry_lantern" time="night"}
::use{component="lampLighting"}
@inspector{mono}: My {{run.day:ordinalWord}} night on Skerry Rock. Whatever else happened on the fourteenth, somebody kept this light burning till morning. I will do no less.
